  "description": "spaCy-class NLP for .NET: the distilled accurate-tier model (a six-layer student of mmBERT-base, fine-tuned) for English, German, French, Spanish, Portuguese, Italian, Dutch, Turkish and Chinese, plus an open-type entity recognizer. Tags, morphology, lemmas, dependency parse and entities for the Nlp verbs; the Nlp verbs use it for these languages when no fast-tier package is referenced. About 500 MB, split over several packages. No downloads. Unaffiliated with other projects named OneNLP.",
